<title>USA: Hibernia in deal to acquire Lousiana bank.</title>
<headline>Hibernia in deal to acquire Lousiana bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hibernia Corp said Friday it signed an agreement to acquire Northwest Bancshares of Louisiana Inc.</p>
<p>Hibernia said shareholders of Northwest Bancshares would receive stock valued at about $21.3 million in a tax-free pooling of interests.</p>
<p>Hibernia said it expects to complete the merger by the end of the year.</p>
<p>The name of the bank will be changed to Hibernia in early 1998 when its computer system is converted to Hibernia's.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
